# Hotel PMS — Elektraweb import module

**Operator guide:** [doc/ELEKTRAWEB-IMPORT.md](../../doc/ELEKTRAWEB-IMPORT.md)  
**Nafta greenfield pricing map:** [doc/nafta/IMPORT-PRICING-MAP.md](../../doc/nafta/IMPORT-PRICING-MAP.md) (BAR, DERIVED, SalesContract — no legacy CPR)  
**ADR:** [docs/adr/hotel-elektraweb-import.md](../../../docs/adr/hotel-elektraweb-import.md) · T-room / deferred checkout: [hotel-deferred-corporate-checkout.md](../../../docs/adr/hotel-deferred-corporate-checkout.md)  
**Post-Excel dual-run:** [doc/ELEKTRAWEB-LIVE-BRIDGE.md](../../doc/ELEKTRAWEB-LIVE-BRIDGE.md) · [hotel-elektraweb-bridge-module.mdc](./hotel-elektraweb-bridge-module.mdc)

## Purpose

Reusable **Elektraweb → ERA** bootstrap for master data + historical guests/reservations/folio charges.  
v1: **platform super-admin only**. Future: organization owners via Orchestrator entitlement.

## Access

| Check | Location |
|-------|----------|
| `PLATFORM_SUPER_ADMIN_EMAILS` | root `.env` |
| `isPlatformSuperAdminUser()` | `src/lib/auth/platform-super-admin.ts` |
| `assertPlatformSuperAdminImport()` | `src/lib/import/auth.ts` |
| UI flag `isPlatformSuperAdmin` | `GET /api/auth/me` |

## API

| Method | Route | Auth |
|--------|-------|------|
| GET | `/api/import` | platform super-admin |
| POST | `/api/import/[entity]?dryRun=1` | platform super-admin |

Entity slugs (v1): `revenue-codes`, … `folios`. **Planned (Nafta):** `bar-bootstrap`, `bar-rates`, `sales-contracts`, `meal-add-ons` — see IMPORT-PRICING-MAP.

## Phases (`src/lib/import/phases.ts`)

1. **dictionaries** — flexible order  
2. **master** — strict top→bottom  
3. **transactional** — guests → reservations → folios  

## Core files

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `excel.ts` | xlsx → rows |
| `run-import.ts` | header map, zod, per-row upsert |
| `adapters/*.ts` | entity-specific idempotent upsert |
| `upload.ts` | HTTP client for import POST |
| `step-status-storage.ts` | browser progress (`era-hotel-import-wizard-v1`) |

## UI (single entry)

- `/admin/import` — `ImportWizard` + `ImportStepRow`
- **No** Import buttons on master-data, stock, travel-agencies, guests

## Verify-after-import CRUD

Post-import fixes use standard admin screens (not re-upload):

| Screen | PATCH routes |
|--------|--------------|
| `/admin/master-data` | `/api/master/{room-types,rate-plans,revenue-codes,bed-types,room-views}/[id]`, `/api/rooms/[id]` |
| `/admin/stock` | `/api/stock/products/[id]` |
| `/admin/travel-agencies` | POST upsert with `id` |
| `/guests` | `/api/guests/[id]/full` |

Audit matrix: [doc/ELEKTRAWEB-IMPORT-UI-AUDIT.md](../../doc/ELEKTRAWEB-IMPORT-UI-AUDIT.md)  
Retire policy (no hard delete): [docs/adr/hotel-master-data-retire-policy.md](../../../docs/adr/hotel-master-data-retire-policy.md)

## Seed

`prisma/seed-reference.ts` — `npm run db:seed:reference` (RevenueCode, BedType, RoomView, **HotelLookup** markets/segments/VIP/…; no wipe).

Master lookups API: `GET/POST /api/master/lookups?kind=MARKET&activeOnly=1`, `PATCH /api/master/lookups/[id]`. Admin UI: `/admin/master-data` → HotelLookupsAdmin.

## Pre-merge (Elektraweb ~1000 row cap)

Before wizard upload, merge overlapping chunk exports:

| Script | Key |
|--------|-----|
| `scripts/merge-guest-cards.js` | `Guest Id` |
| `scripts/merge-reservations.js` | `Res Id` |
| `scripts/merge-folio-transactions.js` | Folio `Id` |

Operator notes: [doc/ELEKTRAWEB-IMPORT.md](../../doc/ELEKTRAWEB-IMPORT.md) §15.

## Excluded

Chart of Accounts → finance-core. Do not add GL import here.

System FOCP rows (`999 FB`, `Sanal Folyo`, …) and deferred corporate `T{ResId}` — see deferred-checkout ADR; do not map to physical `Room`.

## Extending

New hotel / new columns → edit adapter `headerAliases` + schema; register in `adapters/index.ts` and `phases.ts`. Do not fork the engine.
